ES:
¡Esto no es simplemente un jardín
botánico!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Si donasen más bichos,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡podría ser un paraíso bichero!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Pero de momento solo es un sitio
que me queda de paso cuando
salgo a correr! ¡Ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
Non siamo in un giardino botanico.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quando ci saranno molti più insetti,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
questo posto cambierà faccia.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Per il momento, passo di qui
quando esco a fare la mia corsetta!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
Burası sadece botanik bahçesi değil!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Bize daha çok böcek bağışlanırsa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} tam
bir böcek cenneti olabilir!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Şimdilik koşu
rotamda kısa bir mola noktası işte!
Ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
This exhibition room is the best!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}You can see all kinds of bugs!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Here's my favorite bug, the one that
has a big horn. And there's the one
that moves around really fast{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}This is such a great collection!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Simply amazing!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
¡Esta sala de exposición es brutal!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Hay bichos de todo tipo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ahí está mi bicho favorito, ese
que tiene un cuernote. Y luego
ese que se mueve rapidísimo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Esta colección es un pasote!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Es de lo mejor!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
Questa stanza è fantastica.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ci sono un sacco di insetti!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Questo qui con il corno è il mio
preferito. Ma mi piace anche
quello che va velocissimo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Che collezione fantastica!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Semplicemente bellissima!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
Der Raum hier ist das Beste am
ganzen Museum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Die haben hier
alle möglichen Insekten!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Der mit dem Horn da hinten ist mein
Lieblingsinsekt. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Und den schnellen
dort mag ich auch{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Omannomannomann!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Was für 'ne Weltklasse-Sammlung!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich schwitze vor lauter Aufregung!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
Bu sergi salonu müthiş!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Her türden böcek görebilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}İşte
en sevdiğim, şu kocaman boynuzlu olan.
Şurada da acayip hızlı hareket eden
var{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Ne koleksiyon ama!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Gerçekten şahane!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hier gibt's nicht bloß Insekten.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Die haben auch Pflanzen und so!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das ist echt cool, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Man muss seinen Gegner kennen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bevor man gegen ihn kämpft!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Wer draußen Insekten fangen will,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
sollte sie erst mal hier beobachten!
